error[E0908]: #Pure is reserved: the compiler does not do what it promises yet
 --> $DIR/reserved-tag.nra:3:1
  |
3 | #Pure
  | ^^^^^ reserved tag
  |
  = note: #Pure: no observable effects, and the same result for the same arguments
  = note: reserved tags are rejected so that no program relies on a promise the compiler does not keep
  = help: the optimizer already infers purity; the compiler checks #Pure in a later release

For more information about this error, try `neura explain E0908`.
